        " اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : «لِلصَّائِمِ فَرْحَتَانِ فَرْحَةٌ عِنْدَ إِفْطَارِهِ وَ فَرْحَةٌ عِنْدَ لِقَاءِ رَبِّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ»."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1780 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"The fasting person has two joys: a joy when he breaks his fast and a joy when he meets his Lord (azj), the Almighty.\""
        ]
      }
